SEL: the SER is read with ``SER 1000`` on SEL-400 series relays (``SER`` only returns the 20 newest records), or with ``CSE`` (Compressed ASCII) if ``CAS`` lists it. ``CHI`` is used for the history only if ``HIS`` fails. ``STA`` runs at level 1 on SEL-400 series relays, before PEAT elevates to level 2.
